@host = http://localhost:5000

### Create a player
# @name createPlayer
POST {{host}}/players
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "FirstName" : "James",
    "LastName" : "G"
}

### Get the player you just created (send "Create a player" first; this reuses its playerId)
GET {{host}}/players/{{createPlayer.response.body.$.playerId}}

### Get a player that doesn't exist (should be a 404)
GET {{host}}/players/doesnotexist

### Get a specific player (paste an id from the database or the app's Home screen)
GET {{host}}/players/2b92d20f698249b2b120e9ea2a52230d
